sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant VOD as VodComputer (site.vod)
    participant Store as GnssResearchSite (store engine)
    participant VODCalc as TauOmegaZerothOrder
    participant Grid as GridData
    participant Viz as HemisphereVisualizer

    User->>VOD: Site("site").vod.compute_bulk(analysis, start=..., end=...)

    VOD->>Store: Load canopy dataset
    Store-->>VOD: Canopy Dataset (φ, θ, SNR)

    VOD->>Store: Load reference dataset
    Store-->>VOD: Reference Dataset (φ, θ, SNR)

    VOD->>VODCalc: TauOmegaZerothOrder(canopy_ds, reference_ds)

    VODCalc->>VODCalc: get_delta_snr()<br/>ΔSNR = SNR_canopy − SNR_sky
    VODCalc->>VODCalc: decibel2linear(ΔSNR)<br/>T = 10^(ΔSNR_dB / 10)
    VODCalc->>VODCalc: calculate_vod()<br/>τ = −ln(T) · cos(θ)

    VODCalc-->>VOD: VOD Dataset (τ per sid, epoch)

    VOD->>Store: Write VOD, provenance and metadata (one commit)
    VOD-->>User: VOD Dataset

    User->>Grid: add_cell_ids_to_vod_fast(vod_ds, grid, grid_name)
    Grid->>Grid: Containing cell: (φ,θ) → cell_id
    Grid-->>User: Gridded VOD

    User->>Viz: HemisphereVisualizer(grid).plot_2d(gridded_vod)
    Viz-->>User: 📊 2D/3D Visualization

    Note over User,Viz: Complete VOD workflow<br/>from raw RINEX to visualization
